- [will_said] IN-PAGE SERVER DESIGN AMENDED + SEED CACHE PROTOCOL SET: streamed view-driven cache — "just stream scrolls as you view them into the cache" — manifest-first, stream-on-view, neighbourhood prefetch, base hashes for SyncBook deltas. Seed cache: server sends a hash envelope on page load, one hash per populated coordinate, O(N). Protocol: client sends coordinate + hash + has-content; tiny unchanged return only on match. Correction: hashing is xxh3_128, NOT SHA-256.

- [observed] SEED CACHE DONE — PRs OPEN: SQ PR #3 (/api/v2/seed xxh3_128 envelope; cache-aware fetch, unchanged return 93 B; key finding: libphext phext::checksum IS xxh3_128) and phext-lattice PR #61 (/api/seed; unchanged 93 B; JS xxh3_128 verified vs Rust/C). Build task CLOSED; both awaiting Will's merge, nothing deployed. Merge wait flagged with NO register entry — adjudication pending (#63 or not-a-register-wait).

