- [will_said] MORNING COMMUTE - DAILY GOAL:
  PHEXTURA (08:47-09:00): start re-encoding
  arXiv in phextura and build the graph of
  all human knowledge on top of it - at a
  level of detail phextura allows that prior
  graphs do not reach. Will: phextura will
  unify the academic fields because it makes
  reproducibility legible and a paper that
  sounds intelligent but is drivel cannot
  pass its checks. Portal + arena design the
  same call: a logged-in person links up to
  10 arXiv articles; collecting any 10 papers
  produces their automated researcher;
  researchers are pitted each round and the
  best deduplication of the round's sampling
  wins. Information is not encoded until it
  has been deduplicated - that buys the
  specificity / precision / accuracy that
  today would need ~10 Nobel laureates.
  Citizens contribute by writing, aggregating
  or remixing papers; everything self-
  contained, no gatekeeping, no committee -
  daily reading is selected by novelty from
  today's submissions. T5: Will is content,
  expects either T5 or T6 to land.

